message: "If you use this tool, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Mixed Model Correction"
abstract: >-
  Browser-based tool for testing treatment effects on physiology or qPCR data
  with a linear mixed model (Line and Batch as random effects, Kenward-Roger
  F test), with pairwise comparisons and downloadable plots.
authors:
